{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Half Light</i>\u00a0- <i>Shadows of the Future</i> begins as the world is being reshaped by fear and control. The slums and shanties\u2014 once places of gathering and survival\u2014are been dismantled, their people uprooted and herded toward the so-called Sanctuaries. Officially, these are safe havens; in truth, they are places of order, silence and slavery, where individuality is stripped away for the greater good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a Jonathan. caught in the shadows of this upheaval, torn from the familiar and thrust into a reality where nothing feels certain. The streets whisper of resistance and fear and doubt spreads like wild fire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covering the events before the Half Light game begins in full, you'll learn and experience the dark history that brought civilization to the bring of destruction.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064770?t=1759209186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064770/3a8b8109a7226f00e50265c19ae8848ebe1b8e85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759209186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064770/5ca11a5443f7c5567bc399afe7a83e6bae156f18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759209186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064770/5ca11a5443f7c5567bc399afe7a83e6bae156f18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759209186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Half Light</i>\u00a0- <i>Shadows of the Future</i> begins as the world is being reshaped by fear and control. The slums and shanties\u2014 once places of gathering and survival\u2014are been dismantled, their people uprooted and herded toward the so-called Sanctuaries. Officially, these are safe havens; in truth, they are places of order, silence and slavery, where individuality is stripped away for the greater good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a Jonathan. caught in the shadows of this upheaval, torn from the familiar and thrust into a reality where nothing feels certain. The streets whisper of resistance and fear and doubt spreads like wild fire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covering the events before the Half Light game begins in full, you'll learn and experience the dark history that brought civilization to the bring of destruction.</p>","developers":["JimJams Games","Deezl","Link Campus University"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3505080","name":"Half Light"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064770/aa2509c7449756f77c851a879c4a7cc6c1d8cf63/header.jpg?t=1759209186","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Half Light Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer (64-bit versions only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 | AMD Opteron 4274 HE, or better.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 | AMD Radeon R9 Fury, with 4 GB VRAM, or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card with latest drivers<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Windows-compatible keyboard and mouse</li></ul>","rec